            "value": "A storage administrator has one production site and one remote site. The administrator configured the RecoverPoint with VNX (SE) cluster at both sites. The current environment has two Consistency Groups configured with two copies each; one production copy and one remote copy. Based on the company's growing business requirements, the administrator has been asked to keep a local copy of the production data."
